*Reproducibility**: Are details sufficient? Hyperparameters, training setup, probe training details\n4. **Claims vs evidence alignment**: Do the experiments support all three stated contributions?\n5. **Potential confounds or alternative explanations** the authors haven't addressed\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n## R1 Review: Methodology & Experiments\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\n- S1: ...\n- S2: ...\n[etc.]\n\n### Weaknesses\n- W1: ...\n- W2: ...\n[etc.]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n- Q1: ...\n[etc.]\n\n### Missing Experiments or Analyses\n[List any gaps]\n\n### Soundness Score: X/6\n### Overall Score: X/6\n### Confidence: X/5\n```\n","uuid":"9ac0b2b8-7e2e-4c8e-b924-c34245e5cb37","session_id":"14cd13ec-1521-49de-b364-b4ef3aa90454"}
