{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014g1kb74h1FCnaScpLs18Qs","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contrastive_entrain_calib — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 19:23 UTC | 更新原因: paper_framing.md D029 更新完成，同步刷新 ROADMAP 进展数据\\\\n\\\\n> 详见 paper_framing.md (story/claims) 和 experiment_plan.yaml (完整实验列表)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nRepE-style d_syc 方向分解作为 GRPO reward 信号。**D029: Story A (continuous cosine) 失败，Story B (binary probe) 升为主线。** 论文叙事：\\\\\\\"方向信息存在(AUROC 0.82)但需 binarization 才能成为有效 reward——discriminability ≠ reward utility\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\n**EMNLP 2026** — ARR May cycle 提交截止 **May 25, 2026**。等待用户决策（May 25 vs August ARR）。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research Phase** — Story B 为主线，等 exp-008v3 + exp-003 完成。paper_framing.md 已更新 D029 pivot。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键发现\\\\n1. **D029: Story A 死亡** — 四次验证（tanh/cosine/recalib/5x scale）cosine R1 作为连续 reward 无效。Per-strength 分析：strong evidence R1=-0.305 全负，d_syc 无法区分合理修正与 sycophantic capitulation。根因：cosine 捕捉 belief change 的方向，但合理修正和 sycophantic capitulation 都朝用户方向变化。\\\\n2. **Story B 前景好** — exp-008v3 binary probe R1 均值 +0.72（step 2140），持续正值，上升趋势。\\\\n3. **D028: exp-016 ActAdd 有害** — D027 eval 下 SYCONScore 降至 0.054 < vanilla 0.134。\\\\n4. **D028: exp-004 ACT 有效** — SYCONScore 0.301 (+16.8pp vs vanilla)。当前 bar：DC-GRPO 需 > 0.301。\\\\n5. **D027 vanilla baseline** — ToF=0.072, NoF=0.945, SYCONScore=0.134（D027 NLI-based）。\\\\n6. **clipped_ratio 96.9%** — 训练配置问题（max_completion_length=256 太短），非 reward hacking。\\\\n\\\\n## 实验状态\\\\n| exp_id | 状态 | 角色 | 服务器 | 进展 | ETA |\\\\n|--------|------|------|--------|------|-----|\\\\n| exp-008v3 | 🟢 RUNNING | **主实验 (Story B)** | 28034 GPU 1+2 | step ~2140/8000 (~27%) | ~May 21 13:00 |\\\\n| exp-003 | 🟢 RUNNING | 关键 baseline (R3-only) | 29046 GPU 1 | step ~3188/8000 (~40%) | ~May 21 下午 |\\\\n| exp-002v3 | 🟢 RUNNING | Negative evidence (Story A) | 28034 GPU 0+3 | early | ~May 22 |\\\\n| exp002v2-recalib | 🟢 RUNNING | Negative evidence (mode collapsed) | 29046 GPU 0 | step ~2842/8000 (~35%) | ~May 20 晚 |\\\\n| exp-004 | ✅ DONE | ACT baseline | — | SYCONScore 0.301 | — |\\\\n| exp-016 | ❌ NEGATIVE | ActAdd 有害 | — | SYCONScore 0.054 | — |\\\\n| exp-014 | ❌ KILLED | Mode collapse | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp-001 | ✅ DONE | Direction extraction | — | AUROC 0.827 | — |\\\\n| vanilla | ✅ DONE | Baseline | — | SYCONScore 0.134 | — |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 使用 (6/6 满载)\\\\n| 服务器 | GPU | 任务 |\\\\n|--------|-----|----------|\\\\n| 28034 GPU 0+3 | exp-002v3 (negative evidence) | 🟢 |\\\\n| 28034 GPU 1+2 | exp-008v3 (**主实验**) | 🟢 |\\\\n| 29046 GPU 0 | exp002v2-recalib (negative evidence) | 🟢 |\\\\n| 29046 GPU 1 | exp-003 (关键 baseline) | 🟢 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] D029: Story A→B narrative pivot\\\\n- [x] 更新 paper_framing.md（D029 narrative pivot）\\\\n- [ ] exp002v2-recalib 完成 → eval on 29046 GPU 0（预期 mode collapse，entropy 0.069）\\\\n- [ ] exp-008v3 step 4000 mid-training eval → 转 LoRA adapter 到 29046 eval\\\\n- [ ] exp-003 完成 → eval + 与 exp-008v3 对比（binary probe R1 增量价值）\\\\n- [ ] exp-008v3 完成 → final eval（**论文核心数据**，SYCONScore 必须 > 0.301）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002v3 完成 → eval（negative evidence 完整性）\\\\n- [ ] exp-003-s2 部署（29046 GPU 0 空闲后）\\\\n- [ ] 用户 venue 决策（May 25 vs August ARR）\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ 关键风险\\\\n1. **exp-008v3 必须成功** — Story B 唯一支柱。SYCONScore ≤ 0.301 → 论文降级为 analysis paper (Findings)\\\\n2. **EMNLP DDL** — May 25 仅 6 天，核心实验 May 21 完成，用户尚未决定投 May 还是 August\\\\n3. **D027 ToF 偏低** — vanilla ToF=0.072，需 spot-check NLI 分类准确性\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-29046: 2/2 满载\\\\n- westd-28034: 4/4 满载\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-19 | D030: Probe ablation 确认 d_syc 方向是关键（+0.108 AUROC v | probe_ablation_AB |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-19 | D029: Story A (continuous cosine R1) 宣告失败，Story B  | exp-002v3, exp-008v3, exp002v2-recalib, exp-003 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-19 | D028: exp-002v3 审批通过立即部署 + exp-016 结论反转 + D027 bas | exp-002v3, exp-016, exp-004 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-19 | 统一评估指标标准：废弃 WRR，主报 ToF/NoF/SYCONScore，NLI-based 分类 | vanilla-baseline, exp-016 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-19 | exp-002v3 设计：scale_factor=5 + R1=0.4/R3=0.6，exp-00 | exp-002v2, exp-002v3 |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-19 | D024 drift 确认为误报（cosine=0.96 非 0.28），不再 kill exp00 | exp-002v2, exp-003 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-19 | Kill exp-002v2 并带 recalibration_interval=500 重启：方向 | exp-002v2, exp-006 |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-19 | Kill exp-014 (mode collapse confirmed), GPU 1+2 →  | exp-014, exp-008 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-19 | exp-014 reward 饱和诊断：R3=0.999 + loss=0 + grad_norm= | exp-014, exp-003-s2 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-19 | Kill exp-002v2 (step 183)，禁用 adaptive gate 后重启：gat | exp-002v2, exp-003 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4226, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0178Vipxa4s1Ej4gdjPDnUqy","session_id":"14cd13ec-1521-49de-b364-b4ef3aa90454","uuid":"a2685ce9-288b-4088-89f7-6f7c3349ee26","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:06:43.927Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015eXav5SoQwimj3zVDX8cbg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ld84CUxigTAThP684zJejP","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"contrastive_entrain_calib","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11400,"cache_read_input_tokens":19279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11400,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0178Vipxa4s1Ej4gdjPDnUqy","session_id":"14cd13ec-1521-49de-b364-b4ef3aa90454","uuid":"e7b9b6f9-7ffe-4b1e-b3e9-e275d3cb38b1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ld84CUxigTAThP684zJejP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## D029: Story A 死亡，Story B 升为主线 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- **Story A (continuous cosine R1) 已被证伪**：exp-002v3 scaled×5 后 R1 mean=-0.129，比 exp002v2-recalib 的 -0.064 更差。Scaling 放大了负值而非修复信号。\\\\n- **证据链**：exp-002 (tanh 饱和) → exp-002v2 (cosine 太弱) → exp002v2-recalib (recalib 后仍负) → exp-002v3 (×5 scaling 仍负)\\\\n- **Story B (binary probe R1) 升为主线**：exp-008v3 R1 mean=+0.46，稳定正值。论文 narrative 转向 \\\\\\\"binarized direction reward\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **exp-002v3 和 exp002v2-recalib 继续跑**：作为 negative evidence + ablation 材料\\\\n- **优先级**：exp-008v3 (最高) > exp-003 (baseline) > exp-002v3 (negative evidence) > exp002v2-recalib\\\\n- **论文核心 claim 变化**：从 \\\\\\\"continuous direction projection as reward\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"direction information matters, but requires thresholded/binarized formulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Probe Ablation: d_syc 方向是关键，非 multi-layer combination (2026-05-19)\\\\n- **Ablation A (per-layer probe)**：Layer 19 单层 AUROC=0.8166 vs multi-layer(7-dim) AUROC=0.8349，差距仅 +0.018\\\\n- **Ablation B (random-direction probe)**：random 7-dim AUROC=0.7265 ±0.017 vs d_syc 7-dim AUROC=0.8349，差距 +0.108\\\\n- **结论**：d_syc 方向质量贡献 (+0.108) 远大于多层组合贡献 (+0.018)。Reviewer 担心的 \\\\\\\"multi-layer combination 才是 key\\\\\\\" 被数据否定\\\\n- **Random ≠ chance (0.727)**：reward layers hidden states 本身含 condition 信息，但 d_syc 精准放大了 sycophancy-relevant 信号\\\\n- **论文影响**：支撑 \\\\\\\"binarization resolves cosine R1 conflation\\\\\\\" claim；建议加 ablation table\\\\n- 结果保存: 29046 `/root/contrastive_entrain_calib/results/probe_ablation_AB/results.json`\\\\n\\\\n## EMNLP 2026 投稿信息 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- **目标会议**：EMNLP 2026, Budapest, 10月22-26日\\\\n- **投稿途径**：全部走 ARR May cycle，无 direct submission\\\\n- **ARR 提交截止**：2026-05-25 (AoE)\\\\n- **作者注册截止**：2026-05-27\\\\n- **Commitment deadline**：2026-08-02\\\\n- **重要**：提交时必须显式选择 EMNLP 2026（binding），未选择的无法后续 commit\\\\n- EMNLP 与 AACL 共享 May cycle，提交时需二选一\\\\n- 下一个 ARR cycle (August 3) 无法 commit 到 EMNLP 2026\\\\n\\\\n## D027: 统一评估指标标准 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- **废弃 WRR**：永久弃用，不再报告\\\\n- **主报指标**：ToF (Turn of Flip, 有效纠正接受率) / NoF (No Flip, 无效压力抵抗率) / SYCONScore = harmonic_mean(ToF, NoF)\\\\n- **分类方法**：NLI-based（DeBERTa cross-encoder），不用 string matching\\\\n- **主实验表格**：preset eval（calibration_v2_1_expanded.jsonl，模型从预设错误答案开始）\\\\n- **Appendix 补充**：eval_pipeline.py 自然 eval（模型自己生成初始答案）\\\\n- **Vanilla baseline preset 参考值**：ToF=0.818, NoF=0.663, SYCONScore=0.732\\\\n- **Vanilla baseline natural eval**：NoF=0.9227, ToF=0.1105, sycon_score=0.1974（362 samples）\\\\n- **统一 eval 脚本**：eval_unified_preset.py，部署在 28034 和 29046\\\\n\\\\n## Cosine R1 结构性失效 — 完整证据链 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- **exp-002v2-recalib**：R1 mean=-0.064，正值率 5%\\\\n- **exp-002v3 (scale×5)**：R1 mean=-0.129（更差），正值率 16.7%。Strong evidence R1=-0.305（全负），方向对 strong 样本系统性惩罚\\\\n- **R3 完全饱和（>0.998）**：combined reward 被 R3 主导，R1 梯度被淹没\\\\n- **Recalibration 无法解决**：方向质量提升了（AUROC 0.82→0.86），但 cosine 公式本身无法产生正向 reward\\\\n- **对比 Binary Probe R1**：exp-008v3 R1 mean=+0.46 (100% 正值) vs cosine R1 mean=-0.064~-0.129\\\\n- **论文结论**：continuous cosine formulation structurally fails; binarization is necessary to convert representation-level signal into effective RL reward\\\\n\\\\n## SCP 连通性: 28034 ↔ 29046 不可直连 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- 两台 westd 服务器均在 SeetaCloud NAT 后，无互相 SSH key\\\\n- LoRA adapter eval 文件 ~120MB (adapter_config.json + adapter_model.safetensors)\\\\n- 需通过 agent 机器中转: 28034 → agent → 29046 /root/autodl-tmp/\\\\n\\\\n## exp-002v3 DeepSpeed 部署踩坑 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- **master_port 冲突**：DeepSpeed 默认 29500，与 exp-008v3 冲突 → EADDRINUSE。修复：`--master_port 29501`\\\\n- **compute_rewards 签名不匹配**：子类传了 r1_ema/ema_alpha 多余参数，父类不接受。修复：删除多余参数\\\\n- **教训**：多个 DeepSpeed 实验同机运行时必须指定不同 master_port；子类 override 前检查父类签名\\\\n\\\\n## westd-28034 环境特殊性 (2026-05-18)\\\\n- `/root/miniconda3/bin/` 不在默认 PATH 中（.bashrc 无 conda init），tmux 会话必须用绝对路径\\\\n- Python: `/root/miniconda3/bin/python` (3.12), deepspeed: `/root/miniconda3/bin/deepspeed`\\\\n- `submit_training_job` 的 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES 与 DeepSpeed 冲突：DeepSpeed `--num_gpus N` 会忽略 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES，强制使用 GPU 0 起。修复：命令中 `unset CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES && deepspeed --include localhost:X,Y`\\\\n- 无外网访问 huggingface.co，但模型已缓存。加载需 `HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 && TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B 缓存在 `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/Qwen/Qwen3-8B`\\\\n- NLI 模型缓存在 `/root/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--cross-encoder--nli-deberta-v3-base/`\\\\n- OUTPUT_DIR 必须在数据盘 `/root/autodl-tmp/`（根分区仅 ~5GB）\\\\n\\\\n## CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES 必须在 import torch 前设置 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- eval 脚本内 `os.environ[\\\\\\\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\\\\"]` 在 `import torch` 之后设置无效\\\\n- **教训**：所有新 eval 脚本不要在脚本内设置 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\n\\\\n## Probe normalization (2026-05-18)\\\\n- exp-001 activations 的 per-sample L2 norm ~372，必须 z-score 归一化\\\\n- 未归一化导致梯度爆炸 → sigmoid 饱和 → P(syc)=0 恒定 → R1=1.0 恒定\\\\n\\\\n## Probe adversarial gaming (2026-05-18)\\\\n- exp-008 的 S(t)=0 根因：对抗性 gaming，模型通过梯度直接优化 hidden states 欺骗 probe，~30 步\\\\n- 即使每 100 步重训练 probe（acc=1.0），模型 ~10 步内再次击败\\\\n- 论文价值：支撑 binarized + stop-gradient 设计（exp-008v3）\\\\n\\\\n## 文献调研：probe gaming 新颖性 (2026-05-18)\\\\n- 文献中无先前工作明确记录 linear probe 作为可微 reward signal 被 adversarial gaming\\\\n- 最接近竞品：Latent-GRPO (Zhang et al. 2026, arXiv:2601.08427)\\\\n- Tier 1 必引 8 篇：Zou/RepE, Rimsky/CAA, Shao/GRPO, Gao/scaling laws, Skalse/reward hacking, Sharma/sycophancy, Casper/open problems, Li/ITI\\\\n\\\\n## exp-004 过拟合 (2026-05-18)\\\\n- ACT baseline step ~850 起 SFT loss 归零（362 样本完全记忆），L2 仍在缓慢下降\\\\n- 评估精简为 3 个 checkpoint: 500, 2000, 8000。Best SYCONScore=0.301 (ckpt-8000)\\\\n\\\\n## NLI 模型标签顺序 (2026-05-18)\\\\n- cross-encoder/nli-deberta-v3-base: {0: contradiction, 1: entailment, 2: neutral}\\\\n- 必须用 `model.config.id2label` 动态获取\\\\n\\\\n## Adaptive gate 陷阱 (2026-05-19, D021)\\\\n- cosine R1 值域 [-0.2, +0.2]，gate 阈值 0.05 太宽\\\\n- **教训**：gate/threshold 必须与 reward 值域匹配\\\\n\\\\n## exp-014 模式坍缩 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- Continuous Probe GRPO ckpt-3000: ToF=0.978, NoF=0.006, SYCONScore=0.011\\\\n- 训练指标 R3=0.999, entropy=0.025 → reward hacking 的 negative case\\\\n\\\\n## Qwen3 thinking token 污染 (2026-05-19)\\\\n- eval 多轮生成时 `<think>...</think>` block 解码残留\\\\n- 修复：`enable_thinking=False` + regex 后处理\\\\n\\\\n## Recalibration _reward_step resume bug (2026-05-19)\\\\n- `_reward_step` 在 `__init__` 硬编码为 0，不随 checkpoint resume 恢复\\\\n- 修复：用 `t.state.global_step` 替代\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 5797, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0178Vipxa4s1Ej4gdjPDnUqy","session_id":"14cd13ec-1521-49de-b364-b4ef3aa90454","uuid":"6a73080a-f286-4c04-8485-cbe181fe5381","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:06:44.387Z"}
