rical projection with robust centroids)\n- CCS (Contrast-Consistent Search)\n- Activation Addition / representation control at inference time\n- DPO/RLHF approaches to sycophancy\n- \"Pressure, What Pressure?\" and similar behavioral approaches\n- Truth decay literature\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n## R2 Review: Novelty & Related Work\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\n- S1: ...\n- S2: ...\n[etc.]\n\n### Weaknesses\n- W1: ...\n- W2: ...\n[etc.]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n- Q1: ...\n[etc.]\n\n### Missing Related Work or Comparisons\n[List any gaps]\n\n### Novelty Score: X/6\n### Overall Score: X/6\n### Confidence: X/5\n```\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017jigZuTcuPVTroaiVbEpbE","session_id":"14cd13ec-1521-49de-b364-b4ef3aa90454","uuid":"779c68a8-5e98-4a05-9160-49e831d738a2","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:06:48.122Z"}
