The paper dismisses CRAFT in one sentence.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/best/review_report.md:73:**Recommendation**: Add a dedicated paragraph comparing the CRAFT reward formulation with R1, explaining why directional projection is preferable to prototype distance for the sycophancy-revision distinction specifically. An empirical comparison would be ideal.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/best/review_report.md:76:The paper combines three existing ideas: (a) RepE-style contrastive direction extraction, (b) CRAFT-style hidden-state GRPO rewards, (c) NLI behavioral rewards for sycophancy (\"Pressure, What Pressure?\"). Each component is from prior work. The combination is reasonable and results are strong, but the intellectual advance is integration and domain application rather than a new methodological principle. The 7.9pp directionality gap is meaningful but not overwhelming, especially on 3 seeds.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/best/review_report.md:114:2. What is the formal relationship between DC-GRPO's R1 and CRAFT's hidden-state reward? Where exactly do they diverge?\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/best/review_report.md:169:2. **Application-level novelty**: The method combines RepE direction extraction, CRAFT-style hidden-state GRPO rewards, and NLI behavioral rewards, all from prior work. The integration is competent but the conceptual advance is incremental. The insufficient CRAFT comparison exacerbates this concern.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/best/review_report.md:173:The paper sits at the weak-accept/borderline boundary. It would move to a solid accept with: (a) 5+ seeds with bootstrap significance tests, (b) CRAFT comparison paragraph with formal analysis, (c) inference-time steering baseline or clear justification for its absence, (d) missing citations addressed, and (e) human annotation of a sample of masked sycophancy cases.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/best/paper.tex:39:[Omitted long matching line]\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/best/paper.tex:60:[Omitted long matching line]\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/meta.yaml:173:        优化景观中为何失效（reward hacking、方向漂移、梯度冲突），贡献是对 CRAFT 路线的 empirical boundary condition。两种\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/meta.yaml:2929:    \\ GRPO rewards (CRAFT); (c) NLI behavioral rewards (Li et al. \\\"Pressure, What\\\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/meta.yaml:3321:      R1 更多是在注入噪声而非有用信号。模型最终行为主要由 R3 塑造，R1/R2  的贡献被噪声梯度稀释。这是对 CRAFT 路线的重要 empirical\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/meta.yaml:3808:      = 1.0），在线训练仍会 通过修改模型参数来 destabilize 方向。这对所有基于内部表征的 reward 方法（CRAFT,  Linear\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T110318/meta.yaml:4389:    \\ to any method using internal model states as online training rewards (CRAFT,\\\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 30]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017jigZuTcuPVTroaiVbEpbE","session_id":"14cd13ec-1521-49de-b364-b4ef3aa90454","uuid":"fdedaac4-6da1-4ced-b0b7-8ad7605161bc","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:07:42.063Z"}
